message: "If you use the code, model, documentation, or other research materials in this repository, please cite this repository."
title: "Mapping the Safe Operating Envelope of a PID-Controlled Exothermic CSTR under Simultaneous Kinetic Uncertainty and Disturbance"
version: "1.0.0"
type: software
authors:
