license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Computational archive for a simulation-based study mapping the Safe Operating Envelope of a PID-controlled exothermic continuous stirred-tank reactor under simultaneous kinetic uncertainty and external disturbances. The archive contains the Python implementation, DWSIM simulation archive, original manuscript, reproducibility documentation, and integrity metadata.
